trait-name-MLSoftFists = Soft Fists
trait-description-MLSoftFists = Your knuckles are soft and untrained: unarmed punches deal less damage.

trait-name-MLBrawlerFists = Brawler Fists
trait-description-MLBrawlerFists = Years of scrap-yard brawls hardened your knuckles: unarmed punches deal more damage.

trait-name-MLShortReach = Short Reach
trait-description-MLShortReach = Your arms are on the shorter side: your unarmed strikes have slightly less reach.

trait-name-MLLongReach = Long Reach
trait-description-MLLongReach = You know how to keep distance and still connect: your unarmed strikes have more reach.

trait-name-MLSlowHands = Clumsy Hands
trait-description-MLSlowHands = You hesitate before every strike: you throw punches at a slower rate.

trait-name-MLQuickHands = Quick Hands
trait-description-MLQuickHands = Street fighting taught you to strike fast: you throw punches at a faster rate.

trait-name-MLFrailBody = Frail Body
trait-description-MLFrailBody = You bruise easily and injuries take a heavy toll: you reach crit and death earlier.

trait-name-MLToughBody = Tough Body
trait-description-MLToughBody = You have survived worse than this: you stay standing longer in crit and death.

trait-name-MLHollowShell = Hollow Shell
trait-description-MLHollowShell = Something is deeply wrong with your body: any serious injury is almost instantly fatal.

trait-name-MLWeakImmunity = Weak Immunity
trait-description-MLWeakImmunity = The toxins of the old world got to you: you slowly take poison damage over time.

trait-name-MLRapidHealing = Anomalous Healing
trait-description-MLRapidHealing = Whatever they did to you, your wounds close on their own: you slowly regenerate all damage types.

trait-name-MLHeavySwing = Heavy Hand
trait-description-MLHeavySwing = Every punch of yours sends people flying.

trait-name-MLHousebound = Housebound
trait-description-MLHousebound = You never learned to run for your life: you move slightly slower.

trait-name-MLRunner = Runner
trait-description-MLRunner = Living under the Combine taught you to move fast: you run and walk slightly faster.

trait-name-MLStiffJoints = Stiff Joints
trait-description-MLStiffJoints = Climbing is harder for you and you fall flat on slippery surfaces.

trait-name-MLAcrobat = Acrobat
trait-description-MLAcrobat = Years in the canals made you nimble: you climb fast and barely slip.

trait-name-MLSneakStriker = Sneak Striker
trait-description-MLSneakStriker = You know where it hurts: your melee hits deal extra stamina damage.

trait-name-MLMechanicHands = Mechanic's Hands
trait-description-MLMechanicHands = Wired implants replace your fingertips with tools: you can pry open doors and most objects without a crowbar, faster than with one.

trait-name-MLCheapDrunk = Cheap Drunk
trait-description-MLCheapDrunk = Alcohol goes straight to your head: you get drunk twice as fast.

trait-name-MLSturdyLiver = Sturdy Liver
trait-description-MLSturdyLiver = A lifetime of rough moonshine made your liver bulletproof: you get drunk twice as slow.

trait-name-MLAugDermalArmor = Implant: Subdermal Armor
trait-description-MLAugDermalArmor = A back-alley surgeon stitched armor plates under your skin: reduced blunt, slash and piercing damage. Cannot be combined with other armor implants.

trait-name-MLAugCombineArmor = Alliance Implant
trait-description-MLAugCombineArmor = Military-grade plating wired into your body: strongly reduced physical damage plus reduced heat, shock and radiation. Cannot be combined with other implants.

trait-name-MLAugBioShield = Implant: Xenobio Barrier
trait-description-MLAugBioShield = A risky xenobiology graft: heavily reduced cellular and radiation damage, plus resistance to toxins, heat, cold and shock. Cannot be combined with other implants.

trait-name-MLCarefulSteps = Careful Steps
trait-description-MLCarefulSteps = You have stepped on every shard and trap in the district: shards, landmines, mousetraps and slip-entities do not trigger under you.

trait-name-MLPickpocket = Pickpocket
trait-description-MLPickpocket = Survival means taking what others do not watch: you strip items from people faster and more subtly.

trait-name-MLPacifist = Pacifist
trait-description-MLPacifist = You refuse to hurt anyone: you cannot attack.

trait-name-MLNarcolepsy = Narcolepsy
trait-description-MLNarcolepsy = You randomly fall asleep for a while.

trait-name-MLFieldMedic = Field Medic
trait-description-MLFieldMedic = The resistance taught you to keep people breathing: you are trained in CPR.

trait-name-MLSelfAware = Self-Aware
trait-description-MLSelfAware = You can read your own body: examining yourself shows exactly what damage you have.

trait-name-MLStoryteller = Storyteller
trait-description-MLStoryteller = Half of what you say is made up on the spot: occasionally you speak a blatant lie.

trait-name-MLMuted = Mute
trait-description-MLMuted = You cannot speak.

trait-name-MLStutter = Stutter
trait-description-MLStutter = You stutter slightly.

trait-name-MLLisp = Lisp
trait-description-MLLisp = You have a light frontal lisp.

trait-name-MLAccent = City Accent
trait-description-MLAccent = You speak with a distinct accent common in the eastern cities.

trait-name-MLLanguageSign = Sign Language
trait-description-MLLanguageSign = You can speak and understand sign language.

trait-name-MLParacusia = Auditory Hallucinations
trait-description-MLParacusia = You sometimes hear sounds that nobody else does.

trait-name-MLSnoring = Snoring
trait-description-MLSnoring = You snore while asleep.

trait-name-MLStomper = Stomper
trait-description-MLStomper = Your footsteps are much louder than usual.

trait-name-MLSilentSteps = Silent Steps
trait-description-MLSilentSteps = You walk almost without a sound.

trait-name-MLSinger = Singer
trait-description-MLSinger = You can sing: press your play-key to start a song.

trait-name-MLBlindness = Blindness
trait-description-MLBlindness = You are permanently blind.

trait-name-MLNearsighted = Nearsighted
trait-description-MLNearsighted = Everything beyond arm's length is a blur.

trait-name-MLOcularImplant = Implant: Ocular Optics
trait-description-MLOcularImplant = Your eyes were replaced with Combine-grade optics: immune to flashes and protected from eye damage. Cannot be combined with other eye traits.

trait-name-MLPhotophobia = Photophobia
trait-description-MLPhotophobia = Bright light hurts your eyes: flashes damage and blind you more.
